    "detailed_description": "<strong>About the game</strong><br><br>Even if you can't fly, you can still jump.<br><br>I want to live on your island of Langerhans.<br><br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br><br>Let's jump and reach the goal<br>If you are a good jumper, you can jump up to 3 times!<br>Be careful as you can only jump up to 2 times if you are bad at jumping!<br>The flight distance changes depending on the jump timing, so it's exciting even after the first jump!<br>Touch the giant penguin in the sky.<br><br>Missing a giant penguin? <br><br>You'll know when you jump.<br><br><br>Movement: WASDor left stick<br>Viewpoint movement: Mouse or right stick<br>Jump: Space key or A button<br>Options menu: O key<br><br><br><br><strong>Streaming and video</strong><br><br>If you want to publish your gameplay on a video posting site or a streaming site, you will need the ability to talk.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>About the game</strong><br><br>Even if you can't fly, you can still jump.<br><br>I want to live on your island of Langerhans.<br><br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br><br>Let's jump and reach the goal<br>If you are a good jumper, you can jump up to 3 times!<br>Be careful as you can only jump up to 2 times if you are bad at jumping!<br>The flight distance changes depending on the jump timing, so it's exciting even after the first jump!<br>Touch the giant penguin in the sky.<br><br>Missing a giant penguin? <br><br>You'll know when you jump.<br><br><br>Movement: WASDor left stick<br>Viewpoint movement: Mouse or right stick<br>Jump: Space key or A button<br>Options menu: O key<br><br><br><br><strong>Streaming and video</strong><br><br>If you want to publish your gameplay on a video posting site or a streaming site, you will need the ability to talk.",
